<figure class="card">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 920 540" role="img" aria-labelledby="mapTitle mapDesc">
      <title id="mapTitle">The SDD landscape: six regions around the shared graph</title>
      <desc id="mapDesc">A central circle labelled “the graph, shared context” with six rounded region cards around it: a shared context, thinking in dialogue, everyone working together, the world flowing in, extending the process, and surfaces. Each region lists a few elements, each carrying its own maturity mark.</desc>

      <g stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none">
        <path d="M290 96 L388 193"></path>
        <path d="M290 266 L354 269"></path>
        <path d="M290 436 L384 345"></path>
        <path d="M630 96 L534 195"></path>
        <path d="M630 266 L566 269"></path>
        <path d="M630 436 L534 347"></path>
      </g>

      <circle cx="460" cy="271" r="100" fill="#f0f8f7" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="2.2"></circle>
      <use href="#mk-works" x="454" y="212" width="13" height="13"></use>
      <text class="s-eyebrow-t" x="460" y="248" text-anchor="middle">THE GRAPH</text>
      <text class="s-core-l" x="460" y="270" text-anchor="middle">shared context</text>
      <text class="s-core-s" x="460" y="292" text-anchor="middle">everyone here reads from it</text>
      <text class="s-core-s" x="460" y="307" text-anchor="middle">and reasons with it</text>

      <g>
        <rect x="10" y="16" width="280" height="140" rx="12" fill="#fbfdfd" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
        <circle cx="32" cy="40" r="11" fill="#0f766e"></circle>
        <text class="s-num" x="32" y="44" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
        <text class="s-h" x="52" y="45">A shared context</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="238" y="34" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="254" y="34" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <line x1="26" y1="60" x2="274" y2="60" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="72" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="82">keeps the why, not just the what</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="92" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="102">added to, never quietly rewritten</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="112" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="122">honest: open questions stay visible</text>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="26" y="132" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="142">joined-up pictures across teams</text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect x="10" y="196" width="280" height="140" rx="12" fill="#fbfdfd" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
        <circle cx="32" cy="220" r="11" fill="#0f766e"></circle>
        <text class="s-num" x="32" y="224" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
        <text class="s-h" x="52" y="225">Thinking in dialogue</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="254" y="214" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <line x1="26" y1="240" x2="274" y2="240" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="252" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="262">you notice, it drafts, you confirm</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="272" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="282">briefings that re-orient you</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="292" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="302">judgement stays with the people</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="312" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="322">finished work: checked, then tried</text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect x="10" y="376" width="280" height="140" rx="12" fill="#fbfdfd" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
        <circle cx="32" cy="400" r="11" fill="#0f766e"></circle>
        <text class="s-num" x="32" y="404" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
        <text class="s-h" x="52" y="405">Everyone working together</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="222" y="394" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="238" y="394" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="254" y="394" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <line x1="26" y1="420" x2="274" y2="420" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="432" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="442">parallel work that does not collide</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="26" y="452" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="462">people and roles named in the record</text>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="26" y="472" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="482">copies kept in step automatically</text>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="26" y="492" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="46" y="502">agents acting on the shared context</text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect x="630" y="16" width="280" height="140" rx="12" fill="#fdfdfc" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></rect>
        <circle cx="652" cy="40" r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="2.6 2.2"></circle>
        <text class="s-num-o" x="652" y="44" text-anchor="middle">4</text>
        <text class="s-h" x="672" y="45">The world flowing in</text>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="858" y="34" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="874" y="34" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <line x1="646" y1="60" x2="894" y2="60" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="646" y="72" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="82">messages and notes as candidates</text>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="646" y="92" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="102">each one arrives already connected</text>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="646" y="112" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="122">sources that notice their own change</text>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="646" y="132" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="142">what users tell us, flowing in too</text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect x="630" y="196" width="280" height="140" rx="12" fill="#fbfdfd" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
        <circle cx="652" cy="220" r="11" fill="#0f766e"></circle>
        <text class="s-num" x="652" y="224" text-anchor="middle">5</text>
        <text class="s-h" x="672" y="225">Extending the process</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="842" y="214" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="858" y="214" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="874" y="214" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <line x1="646" y1="240" x2="894" y2="240" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="646" y="252" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="262">ways of working a team can adapt</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="646" y="272" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="282">shared know-how a project can override</text>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="646" y="292" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="302">lessons that hold themselves up</text>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="646" y="312" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="666" y="322">a project’s own vocabulary, explicit</text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect x="630" y="376" width="280" height="140" rx="12" fill="#fbfdfd" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
        <circle cx="652" cy="400" r="11" fill="#0f766e"></circle>
        <text class="s-num" x="652" y="404" text-anchor="middle">6</text>
        <text class="s-h" x="672" y="405">Surfaces: the ways in</text>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="842" y="394" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="858" y="394" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="874" y="394" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <line x1="646" y1="420" x2="894" y2="420" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <line x1="652" y1="446" x2="652" y2="462" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.6"></line>
        <line x1="652" y1="476" x2="652" y2="490" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="3 3" marker-end="url(#ar-grey)"></line>
        <use href="#mk-works" x="646" y="433" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="670" y="443">terminal with a coding agent</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="670" y="456">the current way in, for technical people</text>
        <use href="#mk-decided" x="646" y="464" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="670" y="474">a hosted version in the browser</text>
        <use href="#mk-idea" x="646" y="494" width="12" height="12"></use>
        <text class="s-b" x="670" y="504">chat, voice, seeing it laid out</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>A region drawn with a firm outline already has working parts; a dashed outline means the whole region is still ahead of us. Inside every region each line carries its own mark, so a solid region can still hold ideas, and does.</figcaption>
</figure>

